(siteUrl\(\) feeds absoluteUrl\(\), which feeds every canonical tag, every Open Graph url, and every entry in sitemap.xml. It) Tj
T* (is derived from an authentication variable, not an SEO one, and it fails silently. If BETTER_AUTH_URL is set to an) Tj
T* (internal hostname, an http:// origin, or is missing on the deploy target, Google is told the canonical location of every) Tj
T* (page on the platform is somewhere it cannot reach. This is the single most damaging thing on this list because it) Tj
T* (invalidates work that is otherwise correct.) Tj
